      "title": "Writing instructions",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Write the edit in plain English:\n  'Relight the scene with warm golden hour sunlight.'\n  'Place this person at the cafe table, holding a coffee.'\n  'Change her outfit to a red raincoat.'\n\nUnique face coming out generic? Append:\n  'Preserve the exact facial identity - distinguishing features: ...'\nand describe what makes the face distinctive.\n\ngrounding_px: how large the model 'sees' the input while reading your\ninstruction. 384-768 is the trained range. Getting doubled/split\ncompositions? LOWER it. The collapsed node below is the negative -\nonly used at CFG > 1; keep its prompt empty."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Write the edit in plain English:\n  'Relight the scene with warm golden hour sunlight.'\n  'Place this person at the cafe table, holding a coffee.'\n  'Change her outfit to a red raincoat.'\n\nUnique face coming out generic? Append:\n  'Preserve the exact facial identity - distinguishing features: ...'\nand describe what makes the face distinctive.\n\ngrounding_px: how large the model 'sees' the input while reading your\ninstruction. 384-768 is the trained range. Getting doubled/split\ncompositions? LOWER it. The collapsed node below is the negative -\nonly used at CFG > 1; keep its prompt empty."
      },
